  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><size=+10>How To Play</size></b>

    When the game starts, the top
    card of the centre pile will be flipped. You then move that card to its corresponding
    pile based on its Rank (Ace to King). Then, the top card of that pile will be
    flipped and you repeat the process.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6622473957194473056, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
