  m_text: '<b><size=+10>Tips and Strategies</size></b>

    <b>\u2022 Pure Chance:</b>
    Clock is a game of luck with a fixed win rate of roughly 1 in 13 (7.6%). There
    is nothing you can do to alter the outcome, so sit back, relax, and try your
    luck.'
